}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Thick-restart Lanczos (Wu–Simon) with full reorthogonalization and locking on −A, from a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fixed start vector; once k pairs are found, a run on the complement of their vectors checks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that no copy of a multiple eigenvalue was missed. A Ritz pair is accepted when its residual","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is at most ","type":"text"},{"code":"tolerance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" · max(|λ|, s\/1000), s Gershgorin’s bound on the spectrum; the vectors","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are then rotated by Rayleigh–Ritz on M, whose values are returned. The dense solver below 64","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertices, or when k is a third of them or more.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"O((n + m) · products + n · k²) time, O(n · k) ","type":"text"},{"code":"Double","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s for the vectors and n · max(30, 2k +","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"10) for the basis.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"weight","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" gives the weight of the edge at each position, read once per position."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"smallest","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is in ","type":"text"},{"code":"0...vertexCount","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"tolerance > 0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", every weight is finite,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and ","type":"text"},{"code":"maxIterations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", when given, is at least 1.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Precondition","type":"aside","style":"note"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inl